  "steps": [
    "Slice the zucchini thinly with a mandoline.",
    "Add the flour, cornmeal, breadcrumbs, Parmesan and a pinch of salt, pour in the ice-cold water and mix until the zucchini is fully coated.",
    "Heat about 1 litre of peanut oil and fry spoonfuls of the mixture for a few minutes, turning, until golden on both sides.",
    "Mix the yogurt, mayonnaise, garlic powder, smoked paprika, lemon zest, salt and pepper and serve with the fritters."
